'''Grandma Wolf''' is an [[NPC]] located on the top floor of {{Zone|Grandma's House}} in the {{Zone|Spider's Den}}. She grants the player the {{Item|Grandma Wolf Pet}}, and upgrades it from {{Common}} up to {{Legendary}}.

