== Trivia ==
* '''Grandma Wolf'''{{'}}s appearance is a reference to the fairy tale [[w:Little Red Riding Hood|Little Red Riding Hood]], where a wolf eats the protagonist's grandmother and dresses as her.
* '''Grandma Wolf''' is likely related to {{NPCSprite|Grandpa Wolf}}.
**Both of them start their dialogue by introducing their respective conundrums to the player.
* There used to be a bug where spamming or holding right-click would upgrade the {{Item|Grandma Wolf Pet}} for free all the way up to {{Legendary}}.<!--
* There used to be a bug in [[co-op]] mode where if the player has a Grandma Wolf Pet, then leaves and rejoins the co-op, the pet will be removed and cannot be recovered. The cause of this is that Grandma Wolf could not be itemized and therefore cannot be salvaged. However now when salvaging it gives the itemized grandma wolf back.-->
* You can have multiple rarities of this pet at once by buying the higher rarity from {{NPCSprite|Rusty}} instead of having '''Grandma Wolf''' upgrade it to free, although there isn't really any benefit to this as it won't give additional pet score.

